### Terraform ###
# Provider plugins: hundreds of megabytes, re-downloaded by `terraform init`.
# .terraform.lock.hcl is NOT ignored on purpose: it pins provider versions and
# checksums, so it belongs in git the same way a package-lock.json does.
.terraform/
# State holds the IAM secret access key in plain text. Never commit it.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example
crash.log
